{
  "title": "Event Horizon",
  "about": "A ray-traced black hole: light bending around it, a glowing accretion disk beamed bright on its approaching side, the far side of the disk lensed up over the shadow, a photon ring and a lensed star field (after Radiant's Event Horizon by Paul Bakaus). The disk flares and the photon ring pulses on the kick. The heaviest sketch here: raise Step if the projector stutters.",
